build-*/
cmake-build-*/
Testing/
CMakeUserPresets.json
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
cmake_install.cmake
CTestTestfile.cmake
compile_commands.json
*.o
*.obj
*.a
*.so
*.so.*
*.dylib
*.dll
*.exe

